# The same record written as a block holding ONE written Structure (`---` ... `---`): the tree is that of the short form, the Structure is the one field of
# the record as written, and it runs nothing (the book #two-kinds-of-receivers): `seen` and `after` stay 0.
# наблюдение явной записью: локалы не публикуются (#flush-receiver-contract)
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
        int: after 0
)
@: shared data[0]
L2:
    ---
        shared\Observed\seen := 5
        shared\Observed\after := 6
    ---
